ed section with the complete license text or replace the entire string resource to keep the diff focused on the actual bug fix. Since this is a program repair task, modifying only the \"...\" placeholder seems cleaner than rewriting everything.\n\nNow I need to verify the exact wording and structure of the GPL v3 license to make sure I'm replacing it correctly. I'm deciding to replace the entire `large_text` string with the complete GPL v3 license rather than just modifying the truncated section, since the goal is to fix the bug where the license isn't fully displayed. I'll write out the full text using the write_file tool.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
